OL,3,GNEWSADead animals found in canal where
OL,4,Achildren row
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Brentford have raised
OL,7,Fconcerns about sewage flowing into the
OL,8,Flocal canal network, with dead animals
OL,9,Fwashing up over the summer.
OL,11,FPaul Keane, general manager of
OL,12,Fwatersports charity Brentford Community
OL,13,FBoathouse, told the Brentford and Syon
OL,14,FArea Forum that the problem had been
OL,15,Fworsened by the "epidemic of heat" this
OL,16,Fsummer.
OL,18,FThe animals were mostly found in the
OL,19,FBrentford Lock basin, where the Grand
OL,20,FUnion Canal meets the River Thames.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
